{"speciesId":586,"names":{"fr":"Haydaim","es":"Sawsbuck","en":"Sawsbuck","ja":"メブキジカ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il change d’habitat selon les saisons. Les gens constatent le passage des saisons en regardant ses ramures."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"They migrate according to the seasons. People can tell the season by looking at Sawsbuck’s horns."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Le feuillage qui pousse sur sa ramure change au fil des saisons. Celui qui a la plus belle dirige le troupeau."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"The plants growing on its horns change according to the season. The leaders of the herd possess magnificent horns."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"They migrate according to the seasons, so some people call Sawsbuck the harbingers of spring."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"They migrate according to the seasons, so some people call Sawsbuck the harbingers of spring."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il change d’habitat selon les saisons. Les gens constatent le passage des saisons en regardant ses ramures."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Cambia de morada dependiendo de las estaciones. Observando sus cuernos, la gente sabe cuándo estas van a cambiar."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"They migrate according to the seasons. People can tell the season by looking at Sawsbuck’s horns."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"季節によって 住処を 変える。 人々は メブキジカの ツノで 季節の 移り変わりを 感じる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il change d’habitat selon les saisons. Certains disent même qu’il est celui qui apporte le printemps."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Migra con el cambio de estación, por lo que hay quien considera a Sawsbuck el heraldo de la primavera."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"They migrate according to the seasons, so some people call Sawsbuck the harbingers of spring."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"季節の 移り変わりと 